#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:19
msgid "Mouse:"
msgstr "鼠标："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:20
msgid "let clicks through to the desktop"
msgstr "让点击穿透到桌面"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configMouse.qml:24
msgid ""
"While clicks go through, both mouse buttons land on the desktop.\n"
"The widget takes the mouse only in the desktop's edit mode:\n"
"that is where its settings are, or ./install.sh with the clicks off switch."
msgstr ""
"点击穿透时，鼠标左右键都会落到桌面上。\n"
"小部件只在桌面的编辑模式下接管鼠标：\n"
"设置也在那里，或带 clicks off 开关运行 ./install.sh。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:30
msgctxt "the account of the widget's own notes: a folder of files"
msgid "local — this machine"
msgstr "本地 — 这台机器"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:66
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "备注"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:70
msgid "Notes:"
msgstr "备注："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:71
msgid "mark the days that have entries, open a sticker on click"
msgstr "标记有记录的日期，点击打开便签"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:75
msgid ""
"A click on a day opens its sticker: the day's events and tasks from the "
"accounts,\n"
"and a note of yours — the first line is its title. Off, the calendar is the "
"plain grid\n"
"and takes no clicks at all."
msgstr ""
"点击某天会打开它的便签：来自账户的当天事件和任务，\n"
"以及您的备注 — 第一行是标题。关闭后，日历只是普通网格，\n"
"不接受任何点击。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:82
msgid "Write notes to:"
msgstr "备注写入："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:90
msgid ""
"“local” keeps them as .ics files in ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes;\n"
"an account from the Accounts page sends them to that calendar as all-day "
"events."
msgstr ""
"“本地”将其保存为 ~/.local/share/plaincalendar/notes 中的 .ics 文件；\n"
"“账户”页面的账户会把它们作为全天事件发送到该日历。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:97
msgid "Upcoming lines:"
msgstr "“即将”行数："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:104
msgid "The next entries, one per line under the months; 0 hides them."
msgstr "接下来的记录，在月份下方每行一条；0 表示隐藏。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:111
msgid "Fetch the accounts every, min:"
msgstr "账户同步间隔（分钟）："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:117
msgctxt "settings section"
msgid "Sticker"
msgstr "便签"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:121
msgid "Frame characters:"
msgstr "边框字符："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:128
msgid ""
"Eight characters: the corners, the horizontal, the vertical and the two\n"
"junctions of a separator — “┌─┐│└┘├┤”, or “+-+|+++” in plain ASCII."
msgstr ""
"八个字符：四角、横线、竖线和分隔线的两个接头 —\n"
"“┌─┐│└┘├┤”，或纯 ASCII 的“+-+|+++”。"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:135
msgid "Sticker width, characters:"
msgstr "便签宽度（字符）："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:143
msgid "Opening:"
msgstr "打开方式："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:145
msgctxt "sticker animation"
msgid "at once"
msgstr "立即"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:145
msgctxt "sticker animation"
msgid "fade in"
msgstr "淡入"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:145
msgctxt "sticker animation"
msgid "unfold line by line"
msgstr "逐行展开"

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:150
msgid "Sheet opacity, %:"
msgstr "纸面不透明度，%："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:160
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Days with entries:"
msgstr "有记录的日期："

#: calendar/package/contents/ui/configNotes.qml:166
msgctxt "palette: colour of"
msgid "Sticker sheet:"
msgstr "便签纸面："
